  "question": {
    "text": "The perpendicular bisector of the line segment joining <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> has <math><mi>y</mi></math>-intercept equal to&nbsp;<math><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then, the product of all possible values of <math><mi>t</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
